<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingBottom: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7' }}>断网也照样用</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.55, letterSpacing: 1 }}>网络只是加分项，不是必需品</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.35 }}>12</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 500, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 190, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, padding: 20, background: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.04)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,247,0.10)', borderRadius: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 300, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 2 }}>没网的时候</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>软件自己顶上</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.68, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>它自带一套规则。断网、或者你什么都没配，那句话照样能解析，功能一点不断。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 160, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.05)', border: '2px dashed rgba(79,224,176,0.55)', borderRadius: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>截图 ⑬</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', textAlign: 'center' }}>断网后的解析结果</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>建议画面：页面提示「云端不可用，<br />已自动切换本机规则引擎」</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 190, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, padding: 20, background: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.04)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,247,0.10)', borderRadius: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 300, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 2 }}>想让它更聪明</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>填三个格子就行</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.68, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>想接一个网上更聪明的大模型，填地址、模型名、密钥三个格子就完事，全程不用写代码；不填也完全能用。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 160, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.05)', border: '2px dashed rgba(79,224,176,0.55)', borderRadius: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>截图 ⑭</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', textAlign: 'center' }}>智能体页 · 接入口三格表单</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>建议画面：接口地址 / 模型名称 / 密钥<br />三个输入框</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 20px', background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.12)', border: '1px solid #4FE0B0', borderRadius: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.9 }}>用不用网络由你决定：接上了，它更聪明；不接，它照样好用。这两条路的结果都会先过一遍检查。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.42 }}>知歇 ZhiXie · V1.0.0</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.42 }}>12 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
